      "treatment_summary": "Levothyroxine 25 mcg daily for central hypothyroidism (started at about 7 months); stopped for 6 weeks at age 3 years for a TRH stimulation test, then resumed. Physical therapy, occupational therapy and speech therapy. No vigabatrin reported for this patient.",
